          "text": "Description: Periodic observations of light sources, light beams illuminating the witness's house, and several \"landings.\" All investigations conducted have failed to corroborate the witness's statements, and no trace could be found at the presumed landing sites. The behavior of potential additional witnesses, as well as his wife, casts doubt on the credibility of this testimony.",
